Modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

In accordance with Section 4(b) of the Apache License, Version 2.0, this
notice states that the following files were modified or added, relative to
upstream DnsLibs v2.8.54, by Roman Kovalchuk in 2025 and 2026.

Proxy core:
  proxy/dns_forwarder.cpp                     - modified
  proxy/dns_forwarder.h                       - modified
  proxy/dns_forwarder_utils.cpp               - modified
  proxy/dns_forwarder_utils.h                 - modified
  proxy/dnsproxy.cpp                          - modified
  proxy/dnssec_ok.h                           - added
  proxy/svcb.h                                - modified
  proxy/include/dns/proxy/dnsproxy_events.h   - modified
  proxy/include/dns/proxy/dnsproxy_settings.h - modified
  proxy/test/dnsproxy_test.cpp                - modified

Apple framework wrapper:
  platform/mac/framework/AGDnsProxy.h         - modified
  platform/mac/framework/AGDnsProxy.mm        - modified
  platform/mac/framework/AGDnsProxyEvents.h   - modified
  platform/mac/framework/CMakeLists.txt       - modified
  platform/mac/framework/Info.plist.ios       - modified
  platform/mac/framework/Info.plist.macos     - modified
  platform/mac/framework/build_dnsproxy_framework.sh - added
  platform/mac/framework/conan-hardening.jinja       - added

Build configuration:
  conanfile.py                                - modified
  cmake/conan_bootstrap.cmake                 - modified

Summary of changes: extended DNS error (EDE) and EDNS0 device-id options
exposed through the proxy settings, events, and Apple framework wrapper;
optional DNS64 fixed-prefix synthesis; a force-fallback-only upstream mode;
DNSSEC-OK handling; and framework build, identity, and hardening changes.

